WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:04.133
Create a small reality scan: what exists, what is

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:07.663
verified, what is merely planned, and what you cannot yet

00:00:07.709 --> 00:00:08.115
know.

00:00:08.812 --> 00:00:10.913
Cite actual evidence where available.

00:00:11.517 --> 00:00:15.360
List two material decisions, compare options, and record

00:00:15.418 --> 00:00:18.042
choices with reasons and reopen conditions.

00:00:18.483 --> 00:00:21.060
For the tracker, you might choose to support the existing

00:00:21.118 --> 00:00:23.057
form first and defer email import.

00:00:23.498 --> 00:00:26.413
Do not mark a real integration live based only on a

00:00:26.471 --> 00:00:29.025
planned diagram or a simulated response.
